  "text": "\n     General Election - 7am-7pm November 3 - Sample Ballot Available • Hollis, NH \n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Online Services   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I?   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \nHome \n                News Flash\nGeneral Election - 7am-7pm November 3 - Sample Ballot Available \nNews Flash \n            General Election - 7am-7pm November 3 - Sample Ballot Available\n                Home Page News Flash\n                Posted on October 02, 2026 \nThe General Election is Tuesday November 3, 2026.  \nPolls are open from  7am to 7pm  at the  Hollis Brookline High School, 24 Cavalier Court \nProcessing of absentee ballots on election day will start at 9am. \nSample Ballot \nInformation on voting by Absentee ballot .  \nOther Voting information including How to register to vote . \nRelated News \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTown Roads Crack Sealing\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome Page News Flash\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on October 15, 2026 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCandidates Forum - October 28th, 6pm\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome Page News Flash\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on October 09, 2026 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDrug Take Back - Document Shredding - Food Drive - October 24\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome Page News Flash\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on October 09, 2026 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTrick or Treat & Trunk or Treat Info\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome Page News Flash\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on October 08, 2026 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTesting of the VotingWorks Devices October 23rd\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome Page News Flash\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on October 05, 2026 \n\t\t\t Minutes & Agenda \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Job Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Notices & Bids \r\n\t\t\t Hours & Contacts \r\nHollis, NH \r\nHollis Town Hall \r\n7 Monument Square \r\nHollis, NH 030